-- ----- fragment: minion_isaiah_58.sql (Isaiah 58) -----
-- Chapter: Isaiah 58 — THE TRUE FAST + ★THE SABBATH A DELIGHT, the anti-antinomian chapter and
-- a framework keystone. The empty ritual fast is rebuked (*Wherefore have we fasted, say they,
-- and thou seest not?... in the day of your fast ye find pleasure, and exact all your labours*,
-- 58:3) — fasting while oppressing is no fast at all (Zechariah 7:5-6 the same lawsuit; Matthew
-- 6:16-18 the fast not for show; Sirach 34:25-26 the man that fasteth for his sins and goes again
-- and doeth the same). NOT the abolition of fasting — the exposure of heartless ritual divorced
-- from justice. The TRUE fast is covenant-mercy: *to loose the bands of wickedness... to deal thy
-- bread to the hungry... that thou hide not thyself from thine own flesh* (58:6-7) — the very
-- works of Matthew 25:35-36 (*I was an hungred, and ye gave me meat*), the pure religion of James
-- 1:27 / the living faith of James 2:15-16, the Torah-mercy of Deuteronomy 15:7-11. The obedient
-- are blessed with restoration: *thy light break forth as the morning... thou shalt be called,
-- The repairer of the breach, The restorer of paths to dwell in* (58:8,12 — Matthew 5:14-16 the
-- light; Amos 9:11 the breaches closed, the tabernacle of David raised). And the climax, the
-- anti-antinomian KEYSTONE: *call the sabbath a delight, the holy of Yahuah, honourable... then
-- shalt thou delight thyself in Yahuah... and feed thee with the heritage of Jacob thy father*
-- (58:13-14) — the Sabbath KEPT and called a DELIGHT, never abolished, never a burden (Exodus
-- 20:8-11; Mark 2:27-28 made for man, the Son of Adam Lord of the sabbath — kept not cancelled;
-- Isaiah 56:2 the man that keepeth the sabbath; Hebrews 4:9 the rest that remaineth; the 1 John
-- 2:3-4 obedience filter). The heritage of Jacob = the two-house covenant inheritance.
