--        NT:     ★★★ Mark 2:27 (The sabbath was made for man, and not man for the sabbath) + Mark 2:28
--                (the Son of Adam is Yahuah also of the sabbath) + ★★ Hebrews 4:9 (There remaineth
--                therefore a rest to the people of Elohim) + ★ 1 John 2:3 FILTER + 1 John 2:4 — THREAD 5/6
